{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moondark is a survival horror hunting game where you're stranded in an open-world forest at night. Main focus of the game is on exploration, non-linear gameplay, and atmosphere.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmospheric Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Atmospheric horror focuses on building tension through mood, environment, and sound rather than jump scares or constant action. In Moondark, the eerie forest, haunting sounds, and sense of isolation create a slow, creeping dread that keeps players on edge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/Forest_1.png?t=1746559466\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In Moondark, you'll gather supplies, avoid danger, and carefully plan your actions to outlast the forest and the beast that stalks you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/Loot_2.png?t=1746559466\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover The Forest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore hidden paths, abandoned sites, and mysterious landmarks as you uncover the secrets of the dark forest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676750/extras/Loot.png?t=1746559466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Key Features:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2022 Handcrafted environments</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2022 Randomized placement of loot</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2022 Non-linear gameplay</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2022 No hand holding</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2022 Suspenseful atmosphere</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676750?t=1746559466","background_raw":"